tes\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-23T16:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-23T16:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"response_preference\", \"batch_id\": \"rp_batch_15\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"NO_APPROVAL_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_rejected\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_rejected\", \"execution_status\": \"not_executed\", \"outcome_status\": \"no_policy_change\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[PRIOR RECORD (advice_review; decision_status: tl_rejected; execution_status: not_executed; outcome_status: no_policy_change) - history, not a standing rule.]\\n# TL rejects a universal JSON-first preference rule\\n\\n## Suggested advice\\nA simulated prior Advisor card proposed: “Whenever the prompt requires JSON, prefer the JSON-formatted response over prose.”\\n\\n## TL response\\nAlex rejected this as a universal rule. A required format violation is a real instruction-adherence defect, but format compliance alone does not establish the better response when the other candidate has a different factual defect.\\n\\nThe review packet lacked the complete prompt and both responses. Request those materials and score the dimensions separately. A case-specific decision may be possible once they are available; this review makes no such decision.\\n\\n## Consequence\\nNo general JSON-first rule was approved, posted or added to the FAQ. Rejection also does not create a prose-first rule. Keep genuinely unresolved trade-offs open for TL confirmation.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_RP_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790883558.000028:d0ddced2\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"title\": \"Slack announcement in response-preference-announcements at 2026-10-01T19:39:18.000028+00:00\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_RP_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1790883558.000028\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1790883558.000028\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-10-01T19:39:18.000028+00:00\", \"basis\": \"created_at\", \"created_at\": \"2026-10-01T19:39:18.000028+00:00\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"response_preference\", \"batch_id\": \"rp_batch_15\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"same_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"UNKNOWN\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U001\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"upstream_review\": {\"review_required\": true, \"review_reasons\": [\"Still unverified after one targeted revision: Independent evidence audit unavailable or invalid: ValueError: summary:3: quotation is not verbatim source evidence.\", \"The only message instructs participants to add affected task references while tracking an issue. The candidate calls this a requested decision about which references should be added. An information-collection request and a request for a selection rule are different; the one-message source does not resolve that framing ambiguity. Keep these fields provisional rather than claiming a definite contradiction or an answered policy question.\"]}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-10-01T19:39:18.000028+00:00 by TEAM_LEAD (rp_batch_15): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\nQA tracking (RP-3558): Model/task connection drops during preference evaluation. Add affected task references here; no policy change has been announced.\"}